<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 28.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 28.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 28		July 25</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.182		  4.472</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  24.321		 23.182</p>
<p>Cash balance		  29.503		 27.853</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,283.741	     5,283.008</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $10 million were issued and $37 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
